----- stdout -----
Rollback migrations up to the specified migration file

Usage: cot migration rollback [OPTIONS] <MIGRATION_NAME>

Arguments:
  <MIGRATION_NAME>  The migration name to roll back to (e.g. m_0001_initial, 0001, or zero)

Options:
      --app      The name of the app to rollback migrations for
      --dry-run  Print the Rollback Plan without changing the database
  -h, --help     Print help


